  "description": "675+ embedded .whfmt definitions for automatic file format detection AND syntax highlighting. Covers 27 binary categories (Archives, Audio, Images, Game, ROMs, Executables...) plus 35 language grammars (C#, Python, JS/TS, CSS, HTML, XAML, SQL, Rust, Go, Java, Kotlin, Swift, YAML, TOML, Markdown, and more). Cross-platform net8.0. Includes EmbeddedFormatCatalog singleton: extension lookup, category browsing, magic-byte detection, MIME type lookup, editor-ID routing, syntax JSON extraction, and PreWarm() for fast startup.",
